      "quality": "poor",
      "qualityReason": "vague"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Old Town, part of Near South Side, was once known as Smokey Hollow due to factories and forges that filled the air with smoke.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
